sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(255,255,255) Browser and private wrapper
        actor Operator
        participant UI as External frontend
        participant API as Internal FastAPI wrapper
    end
    box rgb(255,255,255) Private hosted runtime
        participant Host as Foundry Responses
        participant WF as Hosted shared MAF workflow
        participant DB as Private PostgreSQL
    end

    Operator->>UI: Submit order issue
    UI->>API: POST /api/chat/run
    API->>DB: Record responses_dispatches only
    API->>Host: Create/reuse conversation and invoke
    Host->>WF: Start shared workflow
    WF->>DB: Create run and persist messages/events

    alt Low-risk resolution
        WF->>DB: Submit once and persist completed output
    else Approval required
        WF->>DB: Persist checkpoint and pending approval
    end

    Host-->>API: Return conversation/result
    API-->>UI: Accepted run and thread IDs

    loop Poll history and consume native SSE
        UI->>API: Read selected thread
        API->>DB: Read/tail durable projection
        API-->>UI: Events, status, approval, and output
    end

    opt Pending approval
        Operator->>UI: Approve or reject
        UI->>API: POST /api/hitl/respond
        API->>DB: Locate exact pending checkpoint
        API->>Host: function_call_output in same conversation
        Host->>WF: Resume checkpoint-keyed workflow
        WF->>DB: Resolve once and persist terminal output
        Host-->>API: Return resumed result
        API-->>UI: Accepted and stream supplies final state
    end
